hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1268","Ahmad bin Abdah narrated to us, Muhammad bin Dinar narrated to us, on the authority of Omar bin Yahya, Saeed bin Yasar narrated to me, on the authority of Ibn Omar, he said: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “praying on a donkey, or on a donkey, as he was heading towards Khaybar,” meaning voluntary prayer. Abu Bakr said: This is Muhammad bin Dinar al-Tahi al-Basri."
